  "translation": "Yura-yas-d yisefra wis sin nnan: Ma tellam d inu, ma tsemmḥeslem i ṣṣut-iw, eḍmsen ⟨את⟩ iqeṛṛa n yirgazen, i yigerdan n baba-kwen, d aseffuḍ ɣur-i, akked yimir n uzekka, ɣer Yizreɛel. Igerdan n ugellid, d semɛin n yergazen, llan ɣur ⟨את⟩ imeqṛanen n tmurt, ⟨את⟩ nutni i ten-yebden.",
